<title>USA: Isolyser sets shareholder rights plan.</title>
<headline>Isolyser sets shareholder rights plan.</headline>
<dateline>NORCROSS, Ga. 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Isolyser Co Inc said on Friday that it has adopted a Shareholder Protection Rights Agreement.</p>
<p>The rights, which expire on December 31, 2006, may be exercised if a person or group acquired or announced a tender offer for 15 percent or more of Isolyser's common stock.</p>
</text>
